@page "/help"
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Help"; }
<section class="support-hero"><p class="eyebrow">THE NORTHSTAR HELP DESK</p><h1>A little help.<br /><em>A smoother day.</em></h1><p>Quick answers for your next order, account or invoice.</p><div class="support-links"><a href="#accounts">Accounts</a><a href="#ordering">Ordering</a><a href="#tracking">Tracking & invoices</a></div></section>
<div class="help-layout"><div class="faq-groups"><section id="accounts"><h2>Accounts & access</h2><details open><summary>How do I become an agent?</summary><p>Your warehouse administrator registers your company and creates an agent account in the desktop workspace. There is no public self-registration.</p></details><details><summary>Why can't I sign in?</summary><p>Check your email and password. After repeated incorrect attempts, the account may be locked. Ask your warehouse administrator to check active status and unlock your account.</p></details></section><section id="ordering"><h2>Products & ordering</h2><details><summary>How do I build an order?</summary><p>Choose a category or search for a product, enter quantities and review your summary. Select Place order once you are ready. You can mix products in one order.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if stock changes?</summary><p>The server checks stock and current prices at checkout. If an item cannot be supplied, no part of the order is saved. Update your quantities and try again.</p></details><details><summary>Is payment collected online?</summary><p>This is a classroom payment simulator only. Print or save the invoice for your records, then use Confirm payment to record the simulated payment. No card or bank service is contacted and no real money moves.</p></details></section><section id="tracking"><h2>Tracking & invoices</h2><details><summary>Where can I find my order?</summary><p>Sign in and open My orders. You can filter by status, review product details and open the invoice. Each agent can access only their own orders.</p></details><details><summary>How do I print an invoice?</summary><p>Open the invoice from My orders and select Print invoice. Your browser's print dialog lets you print or save a PDF. Use Confirm payment on the invoice after keeping a copy for your records.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel an order?</summary><p>Contact your warehouse administrator. They can cancel an order before it is shipped; its reserved stock is restored once. A paid classroom invoice is marked Refunded. Shipped orders cannot be cancelled in this workflow.</p></details><details><summary>When will my delivery arrive?</summary><p>Order status is maintained by your warehouse administrator. This demo does not provide a carrier tracking feed or a promised delivery date.</p></details></section></div><aside class="help-card"><img src="/media/nova-3d-v2.webp" alt="Nova is ready to help" width="1200" height="1334" /><h2>Need a friendly nudge?</h2><p>Ask Nova for product ideas and quick guidance. For account changes or delivery arrangements, contact your warehouse administrator.</p><button class="primary wide" type="button" data-open-assistant>Ask Nova ↗</button><a class="soft-link" asp-page="/Orders/Index">Open my orders ↗</a></aside></div>
